OL,5,G1100 The Week in Westminster
OL,6,     FCaroline Wheeler, the political
OL,7,     Feditor of The i Paper assesses the
OL,8,     Flatest developments at
OL,9,     FWestminster.
OL,10,G1130 From Our Own Correspondent
OL,11,     FConcerns are rising in Kyiv as
OL,12,     FRussia's daily attacks intensify
OL,13,     Fand another winter of war
OL,14,     Fapproaches. Meanwhile in rural
OL,15,     Ftowns, elderly Ukrainians are
OL,16,     Frelying on food parcels.
OL,17,G1200 News Summary
OL,18,G1204 Money Box
OL,19,     FIf you're a pensioner due to
OL,20,     Freceive the Winter Fuel Payment
OL,21,     Fyou have until 20 September to opt
OL,22,     Fout if you want to.
OL,23,VpppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG19/19
